{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc50","title":"Buture VC50 Blue Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 33KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eWithout the limitations of a power cord, cordless stick vacuums have revolutionized home cleaning by offering powerful performance. The Buture VC50 cordless vacuum cleaner boasts impressive suction and long-lasting battery life, making it a top choice for convenient and efficient cleaning. With its extendable stick and detachable design that converts into a handheld vacuum, you can effortlessly navigate around furniture, reach high and low spots, and clean your car interiors without any hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAutomatically Adjust Suction\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you're seeking a high-performance cordless stick vacuum with smart features and without a steep price tag, the VC50 Blue is a top contender. It offers three suction modes: 13Kpa, 23Kpa, and 33Kpa, allowing you to customize the power for various cleaning tasks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Auto Mode, the vacuum cleaner intuitively adapts to different floor types, optimizing suction power and runtime between carpets and hard floors. This smart adjustment ensures efficient cleaning without draining the battery unnecessarily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn our use, the VC50 Blue excelled on both hard floors and carpets, effectively removing dirt from edges and corners. The flexible stick design makes it easy to clean under furniture, and the LED headlights help illuminate dark areas, ensuring thorough cleaning.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConvenient Wall-Charging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlways ready for your next clean! The BuTure VC50 cordless stick vacuum, with its sleek design, fits seamlessly into modern interiors. Unlike ordinary wall mount stands, it is equipped with a wall-mounted docking station that allows you to charge your vacuum directly while you store it. This means your vacuum is always charged and ready for use, saving you from the hassle of waiting for it to recharge before your next cleaning session.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe battery is also removable, providing flexibility to meet various charging needs. This thoughtful feature ensures you can charge the battery separately, making it convenient if you have limited wall outlets or need to charge multiple batteries at once. However, it's worth noting that while the docking station and removable battery are great for convenience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eIntelligent Features and Versatile Functionality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eLED Touch Screen Features\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn LED Touch Screen on the top of the stick allows you to switch Auto \u0026amp; Manual modes seamlessly while vacuuming. This feature keeps you informed about battery life and maintenance needs, ensuring an optimized cleaning experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eTransforming to a Handheld Vacuum\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe stick of the VC50 can be easily removed and transformed into a handheld vacuum. Combined with the telescopic tube, it offers versatile floor-to-ceiling cleaning capabilities.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eEfficient Air Filtration System\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to the advanced multi-layer filtration of this stick vacuum, VC50 captures pet dander and fine dust, expelling cleaner air. This makes it ideal for households with pets or allergies, maintaining a healthier indoor environment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhole-Home Cleaning\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eLong Battery Life and Large Canister\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy up to 50 minutes of battery life in MIN suction mode, ensuring thorough whole-house cleaning. The 1.2L large canister on the top of the stick minimizes the need for frequent emptying. It is easy to empty the dust after you flick the switch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eMultiple Cleaning Tools\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC50 Blue comes equipped with a crevice tool and a 2-in-1 brush, providing versatile solutions for various cleaning tasks. These attachments make it easy to clean tight spaces, upholstery, and a range of surfaces throughout your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrently available at a competitive price, the VC50 Blue offers outstanding value, combining advanced features typically found in higher-end models with affordability. It's an excellent choice for those looking for a reliable and smart cordless stick vacuum.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1-year warranty, you can get a 3-year warranty after your registration on Buture Official Store.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat in the box:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Pack x1 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrevice Tool x1 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2-in-1 Brush x1 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Dock with Hardware Pack x1 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSponge Filters x2 \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHEPA Filters x2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VC50 Blue Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .vc50-details-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .vc50-details-table th, .vc50-details-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .vc50-details-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .vc50-details-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc50-details-table\" style=\"width: 99.9282%; height: 235.096px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eAuto-adjust Suction\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e13Kpa, 23Kpa, 33Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eUp to 50 minutes in MIN suction mode\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eDustbin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e1.2L\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e2.64kg\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eNoise Level\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e68 dB\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 39.1827px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 39.1827px;\"\u003eVersatile Attachments\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 39.1827px;\"\u003eTelescopic tube, crevice tool, 2-in-1 brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eCharging Dock\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eWall-mounted with hardware pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eFilters Included\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eSponge filters x2, Inlet HEPA filters x2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5913px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eWarranty\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.8594%; height: 19.5913px;\"\u003eUp to 3 years\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45499200340223,"sku":"VC50B","price":145.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_VC50_Blue-Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1745900282","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc50","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}